WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.802
Modern generative models keep improving in
resolution and detail,

00:00:03.882 --> 00:00:07.685
but every gain costs more training time, a bigger model,

00:00:07.765 --> 00:00:11.567
and large field-of-view images that are hard to collect.

00:00:11.647 --> 00:00:15.450
Worse, existing generators are locked to their
training resolution.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:19.332
Push them larger,

00:00:19.412 --> 00:00:23.215
and compute and memory explode quadratically while
global structure falls apart.

00:00:23.295 --> 00:00:27.097
InfinityGAN asks how to escape this coupling and
synthesize arbitrary,

00:00:27.177 --> 00:00:30.980
even infinite images from finite data on modest hardware.
